From rafa@jhu.edu  Wed May 15 16:00:33 2002
From: rafa@jhu.edu (Rafael A. Irizarry)
Date: Wed, 15 May 2002 11:00:33 -0400 (EDT)
Subject: [BioC] Question about affy
