Hi All,

We will be updating the Bioconductor website to allow searching and downloading
of packages and documents (e.g. package vignettes) based on keywords.

Keywords might reflect the type of biological data (e.g. cDNA array data,
Affy data, sequence data), the type of analysis (e.g. normalization), etc.

Here is an initial and unstructured list of keywords to start/continue
discussion. Please e-mail your suggestions regarding keywords and how to structure
the list.

Best,
Sandrine

cDNA arrays
oligonucleotide arrays/Affymetrix
datasets

novice/basics
infrastructure/base
data management
input & output
preprocessing/normalization
graphics/plotting
annotation
differential gene expression/gene screening/gene filtering
clustering
classification
resampling

